---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '@/components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Picture from '@/components/Picture.astro';
import FaqList from '@/components/FaqList.astro';
import { faqs } from '@/content/faqs';
import { site } from '@/content/site';
import { resolve } from '@/lib/mode';
import { productList } from '@/content/products';

const crumbs = [{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Installation & delivery' }];
const coverage = resolve(site.coverage);
const checklist = [
  'Where the sauna would stand, and whether the ground there is level and firm',
  'Base dimensions, load and level, once confirmed for your model',
  'Access width and height along the whole route',
  'Corners, gates and steps the cabin has to pass',
  'Overhead obstructions such as branches, cables or structures',
  'Drainage near the planned position',
  'Equipment and maintenance clearances around the cabin',
  'Electrical preparation, assessed separately and following the approved equipment specification',
];
---
<Base
  title="Outdoor Sauna Installation & Delivery | Alder & Ember"
  description="How we check your space and access, prepare the site, agree who does what, and deliver and hand over your outdoor sauna."
  breadcrumbs={crumbs}
>
  <header class="page-head container">
    <Breadcrumbs items={crumbs} />
    <h1>Installation &amp; delivery</h1>
    <p class="lead">We check the space and access before confirming your installation, and set out who does what in your itemised quotation.</p>
    <nav class="jump" aria-label="On this page">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#area">Check the area</a></li>
        <li><a href="#assess">Assess the space</a></li>
        <li><a href="#prepare">Prepare the site</a></li>
        <li><a href="#responsibilities">Agree responsibilities</a></li>
        <li><a href="#delivery">Delivery and handover</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="section section--flush-top" id="area" aria-labelledby="area-title">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="c-4">
        <p class="label muted">1</p>
        <h2 id="area-title">Check the area</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="c-7 c-start-6 prose">
        {coverage
          ? <p>{coverage}</p>
          : <p>We confirm where we can install when we review your project.</p>}
        <p>
          We take a postcode so that we can review where you are. A postcode that looks valid does not on its own mean we can install there, and we do not run an automatic coverage check. We confirm availability with you.
        </p>
        <p class="muted">Nothing on this page is a guarantee of coverage. We confirm availability with you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section is-surface" id="assess" aria-labelledby="assess-title">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="c-4">
        <p class="label muted">2</p>
        <h2 id="assess-title">Assess the space</h2>
        <div style="margin-top: var(--s-5)"><Picture id="site-access" sizes="(min-width: 960px) 32vw, 100vw" /></div>
      </div>
      <div class="c-7 c-start-6 prose">
        <p>Photographs and approximate measurements start the review. Tell us where the sauna would go and how it would get there.</p>
        <p>Straightforward sites may be assessed through photos or a video call. More complex sites may need a visit. Either way, we check the space and access before your order is confirmed.</p>
        <p><a class="text-link" href="/plan-your-sauna">Plan your sauna <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="prepare" aria-labelledby="prepare-title">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="c-4">
        <p class="label muted">3</p>
        <h2 id="prepare-title">Prepare the site</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top: var(--s-4)">
          A checklist of what we will ask about. We do not give generic measurements, because the right figures depend on your model, heater and site.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="c-8 stack" style="--stack: var(--s-6)">
        <ul class="check-list">
          {checklist.map((c) => <li>{c}</li>)}
        </ul>
        <div>
          <h3 class="h4">Model-specific requirements</h3>
          <p class="muted" style="margin-top: var(--s-2); max-width: 40em">
            Base size, clearances, access requirements and weight come from the manufacturer’s approved drawings. They are not yet published, so we confirm them for your model during the site review. Downloadable guides appear here once approved.
          </p>
          <ul class="plain-links">
            {productList.map((p) => <li><a href={`/saunas/${p.slug}#specifications`}>{p.name}: dimensions and requirements <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>)}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section is-surface" id="responsibilities" aria-labelledby="resp-title">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="c-4">
        <p class="label muted">4</p>
        <h2 id="resp-title">Agree responsibilities</h2>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top: var(--s-4)">Your itemised quotation names who does each task.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="c-8 two-col">
        <div>
          <h3 class="h4">Within our installation scope</h3>
          <ul class="plain-list">
            <li>Assembly or positioning, as agreed</li>
            <li>Fitting supplied components, within the agreed scope</li>
            <li>Installation checks</li>
            <li>Handover with you</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="h4">Assessed separately</h3>
          <ul class="plain-list">
            <li>Ground preparation</li>
            <li>Electrical connection</li>
            <li>Specialist lifting</li>
            <li>Non-standard access work</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="note">The quotation says whether each of these is ours, yours, or your contractor’s.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="delivery" aria-labelledby="delivery-title">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="c-4">
        <p class="label muted">5</p>
        <h2 id="delivery-title">Delivery and handover</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="c-7 c-start-6 prose">
        <p>We confirm the schedule and site readiness before delivery. After installation checks, we hand over with you and give you an accessible first point of contact for care questions.</p>
        <p>Lead times are confirmed in your quotation. They depend on a confirmed specification and production scheduling, so we do not promise installation dates in advance.</p>
        <p><a class="text-link" href="/care-support">Care &amp; support <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section is-surface" aria-labelledby="journey-title">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="c-4">
        <p class="label muted">The whole journey</p>
        <h2 id="journey-title">From consultation to aftercare</h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="c-8 journey">
        <li><strong>Consultation.</strong> We talk through your space, who will use the sauna and the model that suits.</li>
        <li><strong>Site assessment.</strong> Photos or a video call for straightforward sites; a visit where it is more complex.</li>
        <li><strong>Specification and quotation.</strong> An itemised quotation, with bespoke changes confirmed by the manufacturer first.</li>
        <li><strong>Order and production.</strong> Built to agreed specifications by our European manufacturing partner.</li>
        <li><strong>Delivery and installation.</strong> Scheduled once your site is ready, then checked.</li>
        <li><strong>Handover and aftercare.</strong> A walk-through, and one place to go with questions.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="c-4">
        <p class="label muted">Planning questions</p>
        <h2 id="faq-title">Common questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="c-7 c-start-6"><FaqList items={faqs} /></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="closing is-forest is-forest-gradient" aria-labelledby="close-title">
    <div class="container closing__inner">
      <h2 class="display" id="close-title">Ready to check your space?</h2>
      <div class="closing__copy">
        <p class="lead">Send a few photos and rough measurements when we reply. We start from there.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/plan-your-sauna">Plan your sauna</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  .jump ul { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--s-2) var(--s-5); margin-top: var(--s-6); }
  .jump a { display: inline-block; padding: 0.4rem 0; font-size: var(--fs-small); font-weight: 600; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; text-decoration: none; }
  .check-list { display: grid; border-top: var(--border); counter-reset: c; }
  .check-list li { position: relative; padding: 0.9rem 0 0.9rem 2.25rem; border-bottom: var(--border); }
  .check-list li::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 1.2rem; width: 1rem; height: 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--c-charcoal); }
  .plain-links { display: grid; margin-top: var(--s-4); border-top: var(--border); }
  .plain-links a { display: block; padding: 0.9rem 0; border-bottom: var(--border); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
  .plain-links a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; }
  .journey { display: grid; gap: 0; list-style: decimal; padding-left: 1.5rem; border-top: var(--border); }
  .journey li { padding: 1rem 0 1rem 0.5rem; border-bottom: var(--border); }
</style>
